abstract: |
  Machine Gnostics is an open-source initiative that seeks to redefine
  the mathematical underpinnings of machine learning. While most conventional
  ML libraries are grounded in probabilistic and statistical frameworks,
  Machine Gnostics explores alternative paradigms—drawing from Mathematical
  Gnostics, a non-statistical and deterministic approach.
